        "You see a sumpsieve pad. Apply the\npad to treat ordinary or lingering\ngas poison. It does not treat fungal\ninfection or prevent new exposure.\nPeat-cutters keep these bitter,\nperforated leaves drying on shelves\nabove the damp.\nOn whoever it takes hold of:\n - Cures ordinary poison and\nlingering gas poisoning; does not\nprevent new exposure.\n\nApplied when used. Can be thrown.\n\nBroad shatters over the target and\nadjacent open cells. Focused Splash\nrequires its skill and keeps the\nsplash in one cell; the total liquid\nbudget stays the same.\nDirect targets only; no ground\nresidue.\nTactical use: Treat an adjacent\ncompanion's ordinary or lingering\ngas poison. Fresh exposure can\npoison them again. Spend one item\nand your own action; only a living\nwilling party member within reach\ncan receive it. Self-use remains\navailable.\n1 unit. Weight per unit: 1. Total\nweight: 1.\nLift Strength: 2; yours: 16.\nYou can carry this item....",
